flowchart LR
    accTitle: Tool and data trust boundaries
    accDescr: A user and human approver interact with an AI host, which uses identity and policy before a validated and authorized tool gateway reaches downstream systems and records audit evidence.

    U([User]) --> H
    A([Human approval]) --> H
    I[Identity and policy service] --> H

    subgraph HOST[AI host boundary]
        H[Host application and policy]
        M[Model]
        H <--> M
    end

    H --> G

    subgraph TOOL[Tool gateway boundary]
        G[Typed request]
        V[Schema and policy validation]
        Z[Authorization and approval check]
        R[Result and postcondition validation]
        G --> V --> Z
        Z --> R
    end

    Z -->|Authorized call| D[(Downstream systems)]
    D --> R
    H --> L[(Audit evidence)]
    Z --> L
    R --> L
    R --> H
